<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ru">
    <head>
        <meta charset="UTF-8">
        <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
        <title>{% block title %}ShopsBox{% endblock %}</title>
        <meta name="description" content="{% block meta_description %}ShopsBox помогает создать интернет-магазин: конструктор страниц, каталог, админка, свой домен, SSL, бэкапы и сопровождение.{% endblock %}">
        <meta name="robots" content="{% block meta_robots %}index, follow{% endblock %}">
        <link rel="canonical" href="{% block canonical_url %}{{ site_public_base_url ~ app.request.pathInfo }}{% endblock %}">
        <meta property="og:type" content="website">
        <meta property="og:site_name" content="ShopsBox">
        <meta property="og:title" content="{% block og_title %}ShopsBox{% endblock %}">
        <meta property="og:description" content="{% block og_description %}Конструктор интернет-магазина с готовой основой магазина и сопровождением под ключ.{% endblock %}">
        <meta property="og:url" content="{{ site_public_base_url ~ app.request.pathInfo }}">
        <meta property="og:image" content="{% block og_image %}https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1556742049-0cfed4f6a45d?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80{% endblock %}">
        <meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image">
        <meta name="twitter:title" content="{% block twitter_title %}{% block twitter_title_fallback %}{{ block('og_title') }}{% endblock %}{% endblock %}">
        <meta name="twitter:description" content="{% block twitter_description %}{% block twitter_description_fallback %}{{ block('og_description') }}{% endblock %}{% endblock %}">
        <meta name="twitter:image" content="{% block twitter_image %}{{ block('og_image') }}{% endblock %}">
        <link rel="icon" href="/assets/brand/favicon-square.ico" sizes="any">
        <link rel="icon" href="/assets/brand/shopsbox-icon-square.svg" type="image/svg+xml">
        <link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="16x16" href="/assets/brand/shopsbox-icon-square-16.png">
        <link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="32x32" href="/assets/brand/shopsbox-icon-square-32.png">
        <link rel="apple-touch-icon" sizes="180x180" href="/assets/brand/apple-touch-icon.png">
        <link rel="manifest" href="/site.webmanifest">
        <meta name="theme-color" content="#F4B544">
        <!-- Yandex.RTB -->
        <script>window.yaContextCb=window.yaContextCb||[]</script>
        <script src="https://yandex.ru/ads/system/context.js" async></script>
        <style>
            :root {
                color-scheme: light;
                --ink: #10263d;
                --muted: #5c6675;
                --line: #d9e0e8;
                --surface: #f5f8fb;
                --accent: #0077b6;
                --accent-dark: #06466d;
                --accent-warm: #f4b544;
                --accent-coral: #ff5a3c;
            }

            * {
                box-sizing: border-box;
            }

            body {
                margin: 0;
                font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
                color: var(--ink);
                background: #ffffff;
                line-height: 1.5;
            }

            a {
                color: var(--accent-dark);
                text-decoration: none;
            }

            a:hover {
                text-decoration: underline;
            }

            .page {
                min-height: 100vh;
                display: flex;
                flex-direction: column;
            }

            .header,
            .footer {
                border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
                background: #ffffff;
            }

            .header {
                position: sticky;
                top: 0;
                z-index: 20;
                background: #ffffff;
                box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(16, 38, 61, 0.08);
            }

            .footer {
                border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
                border-bottom: 0;
                color: var(--muted);
            }

            .site-footer {
                padding: 22px 0;
                background: #0d2236;
                color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.78);
            }

            .footer-minimal {
                display: flex;
                align-items: center;
                justify-content: flex-start;
                gap: 18px;
                flex-wrap: wrap;
            }

            .footer-minimal a {
                color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.78);
            }

            .footer-minimal a:hover {
                color: #ffffff;
            }

            .wrap {
                width: min(1080px, calc(100% - 32px));
                margin: 0 auto;
            }

            .nav {
                min-height: 64px;
                display: flex;
                align-items: center;
                justify-content: space-between;
                gap: 24px;
            }

            .brand {
                display: inline-flex;
                align-items: center;
                font-weight: 700;
                letter-spacing: 0;
            }

            .brand-logo {
                display: block;
                width: 188px;
                height: 58px;
                object-fit: contain;
                border-radius: 8px;
            }

            .links {
                display: flex;
                align-items: center;
                gap: 16px;
                flex-wrap: wrap;
            }

            .main {
                flex: 1;
            }

            .hero {
                padding: 56px 0 40px;
                background: var(--surface);
                border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
            }

            .hero h1,
            .section h1,
            .section h2 {
                margin: 0 0 12px;
                line-height: 1.15;
            }

            .hero p,
            .muted {
                color: var(--muted);
            }

            .section {
                padding: 36px 0;
            }

            .eyebrow {
                margin: 0 0 8px;
                color: var(--accent);
                font-weight: 700;
            }

            .legal-page {
                padding: 72px 0;
            }

            .legal-page h1 {
                margin: 0 0 14px;
                line-height: 1.15;
            }

            .legal-note {
                max-width: 760px;
                margin-top: 28px;
                padding: 24px;
                border: 1px solid var(--line);
                border-radius: 8px;
                background: var(--surface);
            }

            .legal-note p {
                margin: 0 0 14px;
            }

            .legal-note p:last-child {
                margin-bottom: 0;
            }

            .grid {
                display: grid;
                grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
                gap: 16px;
            }

            .product {
                border: 1px solid var(--line);
                border-radius: 8px;
                padding: 18px;
                min-height: 150px;
            }

            .product h2,
            .product h3 {
                margin: 0 0 8px;
            }

            .button {
                display: inline-flex;
                min-height: 40px;
                align-items: center;
                justify-content: center;
                padding: 8px 14px;
                border-radius: 8px;
                color: #ffffff;
                background: var(--accent);
                font-weight: 700;
            }

            .button:hover {
                text-decoration: none;
                background: var(--accent-dark);
            }

            .button-secondary {
                color: var(--accent);
                background: #ffffff;
                border: 1px solid var(--accent);
            }

            .button-secondary:hover {
                color: #ffffff;
                background: var(--accent);
            }

            .auth-card {
                max-width: 520px;
            }

            .auth-switch {
                display: inline-flex;
                gap: 4px;
                padding: 4px;
                margin: 0 0 18px;
                border: 1px solid var(--line);
                border-radius: 8px;
                background: #f5f9fc;
            }

            .auth-switch label {
                cursor: pointer;
            }

            .auth-switch input {
                position: absolute;
                opacity: 0;
                pointer-events: none;
            }

            .auth-switch span {
                display: inline-flex;
                min-height: 36px;
                align-items: center;
                padding: 7px 14px;
                border-radius: 6px;
                color: var(--muted);
                font-weight: 700;
            }

            .auth-switch input:checked + span {
                color: #ffffff;
                background: var(--accent);
            }

            .form-field {
                display: grid;
                gap: 7px;
                margin: 0 0 18px;
            }

            .form-field label {
                font-weight: 700;
            }

            .field-hint {
                color: var(--muted);
                font-size: 13px;
                line-height: 1.4;
            }

            .field-hint[data-state="success"] {
                color: #0a7a3d;
                font-weight: 700;
            }

            .field-hint[data-state="error"] {
                color: #b42318;
                font-weight: 700;
            }

            .form-field input,
            .form-field select,
            .legal-note input[type="text"],
            .legal-note input[type="email"],
            .legal-note input[type="tel"] {
                width: 100%;
                box-sizing: border-box;
                min-height: 44px;
                padding: 10px 12px;
                border: 1px solid var(--line);
                border-radius: 8px;
                font: inherit;
                background: #ffffff;
            }

            .form-field input:focus,
            .form-field select:focus,
            .legal-note input[type="text"]:focus,
            .legal-note input[type="email"]:focus,
            .legal-note input[type="tel"]:focus {
                outline: 2px solid rgba(0, 115, 230, 0.18);
                border-color: var(--accent);
            }

            .nowrap {
                white-space: nowrap;
            }

            .site-hero {
                min-height: 640px;
                display: flex;
                align-items: center;
                color: #ffffff;
                background:
                    linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(6, 28, 52, 0.86), rgba(244, 181, 68, 0.28), rgba(255, 90, 60, 0.18)),
                    url("https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1556742049-0cfed4f6a45d?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1800&q=80") center / cover;
            }

            .site-hero h1 {
                max-width: 900px;
                margin: 0 0 18px;
                font-size: 56px;
                line-height: 1.08;
            }

            .site-hero p {
                max-width: 620px;
                color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.86);
                font-size: 20px;
            }

            .site-band {
                padding: 56px 0;
                scroll-margin-top: 82px;
            }

            .site-band.alt {
                background: var(--surface);
            }

            .site-ad-band {
                padding: 22px 0 48px;
                background:
                    linear-gradient(180deg, var(--surface), #ffffff);
            }

            .site-ad-slot {
                display: grid;
                grid-template-columns: auto 1fr;
                column-gap: 16px;
                row-gap: 4px;
                align-items: center;
                padding: 18px 22px;
                border: 1px solid #c6d5e3;
                border-radius: 8px;
                background: #ffffff;
                color: var(--muted);
                box-shadow: 0 12px 28px rgba(16, 38, 61, 0.08);
            }

            .site-ad-slot span {
                grid-row: span 2;
                display: inline-flex;
                align-items: center;
                min-height: 32px;
                padding: 6px 10px;
                border-radius: 8px;
                background: #fff4d3;
                color: #6d4c00;
                font-weight: 700;
                font-size: 13px;
            }

            .site-ad-slot strong {
                display: block;
                color: var(--ink);
                font-size: 18px;
            }

            .site-ad-slot small {
                font-size: 14px;
                line-height: 1.45;
            }

            .split {
                display: grid;
                grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(280px, 420px);
                gap: 32px;
                align-items: center;
            }

            .feature-list {
                display: grid;
                grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
                gap: 16px;
                margin-top: 24px;
            }

            .metric {
                border-left: 4px solid var(--accent-warm);
                padding-left: 14px;
            }

            .metric strong {
                display: block;
                font-size: 30px;
            }

            .support-list {
                display: grid;
                gap: 14px;
                margin: 22px 0;
            }

            .support-list div {
                border-left: 4px solid var(--accent-warm);
                padding-left: 14px;
            }

            .support-list strong,
            .support-list span {
                display: block;
            }

            .support-list span {
                color: var(--muted);
            }

            .photo {
                width: 100%;
                min-height: 320px;
                object-fit: cover;
                border-radius: 8px;
            }

            .builder-preview {
                min-height: 340px;
                overflow: hidden;
                border: 1px solid var(--line);
                border-radius: 8px;
                background: #ffffff;
                box-shadow: 0 16px 40px rgba(23, 33, 31, 0.12);
            }

            .builder-toolbar {
                min-height: 52px;
                display: flex;
                align-items: center;
                justify-content: space-between;
                gap: 16px;
                padding: 12px 16px;
                border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
                background: #f6f9fc;
            }

            .builder-toolbar span,
            .builder-sidebar span,
            .builder-section span {
                color: var(--muted);
                font-size: 14px;
            }

            .builder-workspace {
                display: grid;
                grid-template-columns: 132px 1fr;
                min-height: 288px;
            }

            .builder-sidebar {
                display: grid;
                align-content: start;
                gap: 10px;
                padding: 16px;
                border-right: 1px solid var(--line);
                background: #edf5fb;
            }

            .builder-block,
            .drag-card {
                border: 1px solid var(--line);
                border-radius: 8px;
                background: #ffffff;
                color: var(--ink);
                font-weight: 700;
            }

            .builder-block {
                padding: 9px 10px;
            }

            .builder-canvas {
                position: relative;
                display: grid;
                gap: 14px;
                padding: 18px;
                background:
                    linear-gradient(#e5edf6 1px, transparent 1px),
                    linear-gradient(90deg, #e5edf6 1px, transparent 1px);
                background-size: 24px 24px;
            }

            .builder-section {
                border: 1px solid var(--line);
                border-radius: 8px;
                padding: 14px;
                background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.92);
            }

            .builder-section strong {
                display: block;
                margin-top: 6px;
            }

            .hero-section {
                min-height: 88px;
            }

            .products-section {
                min-height: 110px;
            }

            .builder-product-grid {
                display: grid;
                grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
                gap: 10px;
                margin-top: 12px;
            }

            .builder-product-grid i {
                min-height: 42px;
                border-radius: 8px;
                background: #d7e9f5;
            }

            .drag-card {
                position: absolute;
                right: 18px;
                top: 116px;
                padding: 11px 14px;
                border-color: var(--accent-coral);
                color: var(--accent-dark);
                box-shadow: 0 12px 26px rgba(255, 90, 60, 0.18);
            }

            .cookie-banner {
                position: fixed;
                left: 16px;
                right: 16px;
                bottom: 16px;
                z-index: 60;
                display: none;
                align-items: center;
                justify-content: space-between;
                gap: 16px;
                width: min(960px, calc(100% - 32px));
                margin: 0 auto;
                padding: 16px;
                border: 1px solid var(--line);
                border-radius: 8px;
                background: #ffffff;
                box-shadow: 0 18px 42px rgba(16, 38, 61, 0.18);
            }

            .cookie-banner.is-visible {
                display: flex;
            }

            .cookie-banner p {
                margin: 0;
                color: var(--muted);
            }

            .cookie-banner button {
                min-height: 40px;
                padding: 8px 14px;
                border: 0;
                border-radius: 8px;
                color: #ffffff;
                background: var(--accent);
                font: inherit;
                font-weight: 700;
                cursor: pointer;
            }

            .cookie-banner button:hover {
                background: var(--accent-dark);
            }

            @media (max-width: 980px) {
                .site-hero h1 {
                    font-size: 46px;
                }
            }

            @media (max-width: 720px) {
                .site-hero {
                    min-height: 560px;
                }

                .brand-logo {
                    width: 150px;
                    height: 46px;
                }

                .site-hero h1 {
                    font-size: 38px;
                }

                .split {
                    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
                }

                .builder-workspace {
                    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
                }

                .builder-sidebar {
                    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
                    border-right: 0;
                    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
                }

                .footer-minimal {
                    align-items: flex-start;
                    flex-direction: column;
                }

                .cookie-banner {
                    align-items: flex-start;
                    flex-direction: column;
                }
            }
        </style>
        {% block stylesheets %}{% endblock %}
    </head>
    <body>
        <div class="page">
            {% block body %}{% endblock %}
        </div>
        <div class="cookie-banner" data-cookie-banner>
            <p>Используем cookie для работы сайта, аналитики и улучшения сервиса. Продолжая пользоваться сайтом, вы соглашаетесь с этим.</p>
            <button type="button" data-cookie-accept>Понятно</button>
        </div>
        <script>
            (() => {
                const banner = document.querySelector('[data-cookie-banner]');
                const button = document.querySelector('[data-cookie-accept]');
                const key = 'shopsbox_cookie_notice_accepted';

                if (!banner || !button) {
                    return;
                }

                try {
                    if (localStorage.getItem(key) === '1') {
                        return;
                    }
                } catch (error) {
                    return;
                }

                banner.classList.add('is-visible');
                button.addEventListener('click', () => {
                    try {
                        localStorage.setItem(key, '1');
                    } catch (error) {
                    }
                    banner.classList.remove('is-visible');
                });
            })();
        </script>
